{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W47", "prepared_on": "2026-11-21", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-11-15 ～ 2026-11-21</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic starts trading on Wall Street<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 正式在華爾街掛牌交易</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic went public on the Nasdaq under the ticker \"ANT,\" opening at $111.50 per share against an $83 IPO price, valuing the company at around $1.5 trillion.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 以代號「ANT」在那斯達克上市，開盤價 111.5 美元，高於 83 美元的 IPO 價，市值約 1.5 兆美元。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1035384/anthropic-ipo-trading-nasdaq\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic mathematician claims to have solved prestigious Millennium Prize problem with Claude<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 數學家聲稱借助 Claude 解開千禧年大獎難題</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic mathematician Levent Alpöge claims to have proved the Riemann hypothesis with Claude's help. The claim has not yet been verified.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 數學家 Levent Alpöge 宣稱在 Claude 協助下證明了黎曼猜想，但這項說法尚待驗證。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1010051/anthropic-riemann-hypothesis-millennium-prize-problem\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Jensen Huang's 'Lying' Alarmed Nvidia Board Ahead of His Resignation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳的「說謊」讓 Nvidia 董事會在他辭職前震驚</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Sources tell WIRED the Nvidia board's main concern was the former CEO's \"lack of candor,\" amid allegations of multiple affairs.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">消息人士向 WIRED 透露，在多起婚外情指控下，Nvidia 董事會最在意的是這位前執行長「缺乏坦誠」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/jensen-huangs-lying-alarmed-nvidia-board-ahead-of-his-resignation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Google gives Gemini the ability to use your Mac for you<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 讓 Gemini 能代替你操作 Mac</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's latest Gemini update brings an AI agent to the Mac that can organize files, fill out forms, and handle multistep workflows.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 更新 Gemini，在 Mac 上提供 AI 代理，可整理檔案、填寫表單並完成多步驟工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/google-gives-gemini-the-ability-to-use-your-mac-for-you/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Trump threatens 'tremendous tax' for moving AI data centers outside the US<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">川普威脅對把 AI 資料中心移往美國境外的公司課「重稅」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">President Trump promised a \"tremendous tax\" on companies that build data centers outside the US, even as states and cities restrict new data center applications.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">川普承諾對在境外興建資料中心的公司課徵「重稅」，而美國各州與城市同時正在限制新的資料中心申請。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/policy/1038892/trump-foreign-data-centers-tax\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> The most misunderstood graph in AI just got a major update<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 界最被誤解的那張圖表迎來重大更新</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new METR report finds some AI capabilities still improve exponentially, but models are not as good at tasks requiring judgment as they are at coding.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">METR 的新報告指出，部分 AI 能力仍呈指數成長，但模型在需要判斷力的任務上，表現不如寫程式。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">MIT Technology Review</b> · <a href=\"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/11/20/1149399/the-most-misunderstood-graph-in-ai-just-got-a-major-update/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Researcher plants 2m canaries into the AI supply chain. A privacy disaster surfaced.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">研究人員在 AI 供應鏈植入 200 萬個「金絲雀」，揭露隱私災難</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A test using prompts with unique, trackable secrets shows that user data does not stay private as it moves through the AI supply chain.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這項測試在提示詞中放入獨特且可追蹤的機密，證明使用者資料在 AI 供應鏈中並不會保持私密。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/a-leaky-ai-supply-chain-is-exposing-secret-user-data-at-an-alarming-rate/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> VMware patches critical vCenter vulnerability, upgrade is the only fix<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">VMware 修補重大等級 vCenter 漏洞，只能升級、無其他緩解方法</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Broadcom patched five flaws across vCenter, VMware Tools and SDDC Manager. The critical vCenter authentication bypass has no workaround other than applying the update.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">博通修補 vCenter、VMware Tools 與 SDDC Manager 的 5 個漏洞，其中重大等級的 vCenter 身分驗證繞過漏洞，除了更新之外沒有其他緩解措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180673\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Introducing Gemini 4 Neon<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google DeepMind 推出 Gemini 4 Neon</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind announced Gemini 4 Neon on its blog. The feed gives no further details.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google DeepMind 在官方部落格公布 Gemini 4 Neon，來源摘要未提供更多細節。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Signal is blocking Gemini and Siri AI from reading your screen<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Signal 封鎖 Gemini 與 Siri 等 AI 讀取你的螢幕</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Signal is restricting screenshots on Android and iOS to stop OS-level AI agents from reading users' messages and other on-screen data.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Signal 限制 Android 與 iOS 的截圖功能，避免作業系統內建的 AI 代理讀取使用者訊息與其他螢幕資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1038390/signal-blocking-ai-agent-screenshots-mobile-app\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}